  'guide.schedule.q': 'How do I add a course?', 'guide.schedule.a': 'In Schedule tap ＋ and fill in the name, time and class days. Courses repeat weekly between the start and end dates, and you’ll be warned about time conflicts.',
  'guide.ocr.q': 'How do I scan a timetable?', 'guide.ocr.a': 'Tap 📷 and choose or take a photo of your timetable. The app reads the text and builds a course list you can check and edit before importing. Clear, straight photos work best.',
  'guide.voice.q': 'How do I add by voice?', 'guide.voice.a': 'Tap 🎤 and say something like “Calculus MAT101 every Monday 9am to 11am at DK1”. The app fills in the form for you to confirm.',
  'guide.asg.q': 'What do red, yellow and green mean?', 'guide.asg.a': 'Split an assignment into steps and tick them off: 🔴 not started, 🟡 in progress, 🟢 complete. Items due soon or overdue get a yellow/red highlight.',
  'guide.exam.q': 'How do I plan revision?', 'guide.exam.a': 'Open an exam and add revision items, or tap “Generate a study plan”. Pick the subject in Focus and the time counts toward your revision goal.',
  'guide.focus.q': 'How does the pomodoro work?', 'guide.focus.a': 'Pick a length in Focus and start. Each completed session earns coins, and total focus time unlocks accessories and expressions for the pig. Studying daily keeps your 🔥 streak.',
  'guide.backup.q': 'How do I move to a new phone?', 'guide.backup.a': 'Go to Settings → Backup & data → Export all data, save the file to cloud storage, then import it after installing the app on the new phone.',
  'guide.lang.q': 'How do I change the language?', 'guide.lang.a': 'Settings → Language → choose 简体中文 or English. It applies instantly.',
  'faq.offline.q': 'Does it work offline?', 'faq.offline.a': 'Yes. Only the first use of timetable scanning needs internet to download language data.',
  'faq.notif.q': "Why don't I get reminders?", 'faq.notif.a': 'Make sure notification permission is granted and the reminder type is on in Settings → Notifications. Some phones also need battery optimisation disabled for the app.',
  'faq.ocr.q': 'Scan results are wrong?', 'faq.ocr.a': 'You always review results before importing and can edit every field. Cropping the image to just the timetable also helps.',
  'faq.voice.q': "Voice input doesn't work?", 'faq.voice.a': "It needs microphone permission and Google's speech service on your phone. If unavailable, type a sentence instead — it's parsed the same way.",
  'faq.data.q': 'Is my data safe?', 'faq.data.a': 'Your data stays on your device. You can set an app PIN and export backups regularly.',
  'faq.update.q': 'How do I update the app?', 'faq.update.a': 'Download the latest APK from GitHub Releases and install it over the old one — your data is kept.',
