  'doc.privacy': '<h3>What we collect</h3><p>Mochi Planner does not collect personal data. Your courses, assignments, exams, notes, photos and settings stay on your device.</p><h3>Network use</h3><p>Only timetable scanning downloads the recognition engine and language data from the jsDelivr CDN; images are processed on your device and never uploaded.</p><h3>Permissions</h3><p>Notifications (reminders), microphone (voice input) and camera/photos (attachments) are requested only when you use those features.</p><h3>Cloud features</h3><p>Upcoming cloud sync and friends features will explain their data handling separately and require you to sign in.</p>',
